                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd7689dd-050a-4fb4-892e-b287a0d08ecb",
                                "sense_id": "c4a97a67-3f5e-3b23-8c7f-0dcbeef2b2ef",
                                "text": "Сперва́ вы́ступил Грыж с позоло́ченной крестови́ной, сня́той в дре́вние времена́ с пога́ной це́ркви и превращённой в двойно́й топо́р. За ним Ду́ля с желе́зной па́лицей, уты́канной сверхтвёрдыми гвоздя́ми.",
                                "translation": "The first to perform was Hern, with a gilded cross, plundered from a defiled church in ancient times and transformed into a double axe. He was followed by Fagg with an iron club, studded with super-hard nails.",
                                "english": "The first to perform was Hern, with a gilded cross, plundered from a defiled church in ancient times and transformed into a double axe. He was followed by Fagg with an iron club, studded with super-hard nails."
                            }
                        ]
